        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "For new vehicle sales, we compete primarily with other franchised dealers in each of our marketing areas and automotive manufacturers that sell directly to consumers, relying on our premium facilities, superior customer service, advertising and merchandising, management experience, sales expertise, reputation, and the location of our dealerships to attract and retain customers.",
        "start_character": 57450,
        "end_character": 57830
      },
      {
