        "filing_date": "2026-02-27",
        "offering_role": "service",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We also offer our customers various vehicle warranty and extended protection products, including extended service contracts, maintenance programs, and voluntary vehicle protection products.",
        "start_character": 24607,
        "end_character": 24796
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001628280-26-012830",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001628280-26-012830-e6eb233998015cdf",
        "accession_number": "0001628280-26-012830",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-27",
        "offering_role": "service",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We also offer rapid repair services, such as paintless dent repair, tire sales, and windshield replacement at most of our facilities in order to offer our customers the convenience of one-stop shopping for all of their automotive requirements.",
        "start_character": 27209,
        "end_character": 27452
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001628280-26-012830",
