        "offering_role": "operator_business",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We operate Premier Truck Group (\"PTG\"), a heavy- and medium-duty retail truck dealership group offering primarily Freightliner and Western Star trucks (both Daimler brands), with locations across 10 U.S.",
